🎗️ 31.57 Core Invariant

A very strong interview concept is the invariant.

At any point:

Only the thread matching turn is allowed to print.

Therefore:

turn = A
→ only A prints


turn = B
→ only B prints


turn = C
→ only C prints

This invariant guarantees:

A → B → C

and prevents:

A → A
B → B
C → C
